  "label": "User projected onto the child in the meme",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the visual material of the child sitting in the driver's seat. The text 'shoot boy, i ain't racist' directly addresses the child, creating an implicit deictic reference where the user (as the viewer) is positioned as the speaker of the text, projecting themselves onto the child as the 'boy' being addressed. The child's surprised expression visually embodies the reaction implied by the text, reinforcing this projection.",
